    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu akirot ke Ekapolon ŋina etoroniyarit Baasa bu neni a Yeu alokoku ka Anani ebala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abu ayoŋ eketopoloo iyoŋ anaraakau ecaryoit, eketuruwo ekapolon a ŋituŋa kaŋ a Ŋisirael, nai iwuap iyoŋ ŋuna etiyat Yeroboam ka irikok ŋituŋa kaŋ Ŋisirael nasecit, ido ikitoŋo iyoŋ ayoŋ aŋuna a ŋasecisya kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun etoŋopiyari Baasa ke ekal keŋ, kikok ekal keŋ ekal a Yeroboam a lokoku a Nebat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyamete ŋiŋokwo ŋituŋa a Baasa ŋulu etwanikinete lotaun, ido enyamete ŋikyeny ŋulu eporete ŋituŋa ŋulu etwanikinete nariet.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo nai a Baasa ŋuluce daadaŋ, ŋuna etiyat iŋes ka arwonu keŋ, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totwana nai Baasa, ido aponi tonukae iŋes Tirisa; kilunyokin Ela lokoku keŋ lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ akirot ke Ekapolon ŋina etoroniyarit Baasa ka ekal keŋ bu neni a Yeu alokoku ka Anani, anerae abu Baasa ke ekal keŋ kitiya ŋuna aronok alokiŋaren Ekapolon; kitoŋo Baasa Ekapolon a ŋiticisyo keŋ a ŋulu etiyae iŋes, kitiya lopite ŋolopei abunio Yeroboam ka ekal keŋ kitiyata. Meere ŋun bon, abu daŋ Baasa toar ŋituŋa a ekal a Yeroboam daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Ela Isirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikanikapei ipukat erwosit Asa Yudaya, kisyak Ela lokoku a Baasa akipuka Isirael alo Tirisa. Abu Ela kipuka Isirael ŋikaru ŋiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Simiri eketiyan keŋ ŋolo apolokinit atutubet a ajore keŋ ŋina a ŋagaari a ŋuna eritae a ŋaŋolei totuk akiar iŋes. Apeikoloŋit eyai Ela Tirisa, emata ka emera alo kai ka Arisa a ŋolo apolokinit akai ka apukan alo Tirisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bu Simiri tooma kai kicum Ela tocakak kwap toar. Apaki ŋin, arae ŋikaru ŋulu epukator Asa Yudaya ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikanikaarei, abu nai Simiri kilunyokin lokicoloŋ a Ela kipuka Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani isyakini iŋes akipuka iboikin lokicoloŋ, abu atipei toar ŋituŋa a ekal a Baasa daadaŋ. Mam ituŋanan ŋinisapat ŋini abu iŋes kimyek eyari ŋini arae iyenet a Baasa, kori ekone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tomunya Simiri ŋituŋa a ekal a Baasa daadaŋ, lopite ŋolo alimunitere anakirot ke Ekapolon a ŋina alimuni Ekapolon aneni a ekadwaran Yeu, itoroniyarit Baasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋun a ŋuna a ŋasecisya a Baasa ka ŋasecisya ŋuna ka Ela alokoku keŋ, ŋasecisya ŋuna kepotu ikes kitiyata, ido apotu torikokis Ŋisirael, toseca, ido apotu kitoŋoa Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael a ŋakujo kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo nai ke Ela ŋuluce daadaŋ, ŋuna daadaŋ etiyat iŋes igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Apukan ŋina a ŋauni: Kipuka Simiri Isirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edolete ŋikaru ŋulu epukator erwosit Asa Yudaya ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikanikaarei, kisyak Simiri akipuka Isirael alo Tirisa. kipuka ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei bon. Apaki ŋin, erikaunit ajore a Ŋisirael etaun a Ŋipilistin ŋolo anyaritae Gibeson. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirarete Ŋisirael ŋulu erikaunito Gibeson atemar aluki Simiri erwosit aar, kitopoloosi ikes Omiri ŋolo arae ekarikon a ajore, kituruwosi erwosit a Isirael akoloŋit ŋinapei ŋin aneni erikaunitotor ikes Gibeson. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Omiri toboŋo alo Gibeson kaapei ka Ŋisirael daadaŋ, kirikaut Tirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eanyuni Simiri atemar ekamar etaun, tolot kai ke erwosit neni aoya alokidiama, kicunyak akai ke erwosit tonom akim iŋes a nen totwan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋun aŋuna a ŋasecisya a ŋuna abu iŋes kitiya aronis ŋina etiyae iŋes alokiŋaren Ekapolon, iwuapit ŋipitesyo a Yeroboam. Arae daŋ ŋun aŋuna ka asecit a ŋina abu iŋes kitiya, torikokinia Ŋisirael nasecit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo nai a Simiri ŋuluce daadaŋ ka ayere ŋuna abu iŋes kitiya, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Apukan ŋina a ŋaomwon: Kipuka Omiri Isirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, totyakas ŋituŋa a Isirael ŋaarei. Toriwo atutubet apei ka Tibini lokoku a Ginas, akituruwor ŋol erwosit kec. Toriwo atutubet ŋinace ka Omiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ŋituŋa ŋulu ariito ka Omiri toreut ŋulu ariito ka Tibini lokoku a Ginas. Aŋun, aponi toarae Tibini ido, abu Omiri toruwor erwosit a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniuni ka epei ipukat erwosit Asa Yudaya, kisyak Omiri akipuka Isirael. Abu iŋes kipuka Isirael ŋikaru ŋitomon ka ŋiarei, ŋikanikapei alo Tirisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kituruworoe Samaria etaun ŋolo apol alo Isirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
