          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Omiri kitiya ŋuna aronok alokiŋaren Ekapolon, kitiya iŋes ŋuna aronok nooi akilo ŋuna itiyato daadaŋ ŋulu epukato eriŋa iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes kiwuap ŋuna etiyat Yeroboam lokoku a Nebat ka abu kiwuap asecit ŋina abunio Yeroboam torikokinia Ŋisirael nasecit kitoŋo Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael a ŋakujo kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo nai a Omiri ŋuluce daadaŋ ŋulu etiyat iŋes, arwonu keŋ ŋina abu iŋes kitoodiu, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Omiri totwana ido, aponi tonukae iŋes Samaria; kilunyokin Aab lokoku keŋ lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Aab Isirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
