        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniuni ka ŋikanikauni ipukat erwosit Asa Yudaya, kisyak Aab lokoku a Omiri akipuka Isirael; abu Aab lokoku a Omiri kipuka Isirael alo Samaria todolo ŋikaru ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiarei ipukat iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Aab lokoku a Omiri kitiya ŋuna aronok alokiŋaren Ekapolon, kitiya iŋes ŋuna aronok nooi akilo ŋuna etiyato daadaŋ ŋulu epukato eriŋa iŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kiit Aab Yesebel, ido kisyak akilip neni a Baal",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwapei atakania aneni ka Aab esibit edit ŋina abunio iŋes kiwuapya ŋuna etiyat Yeroboam alokoku a Nebat, abu Aab kiit Yesebel nakoku a Esibaal a erwosit a ŋolo a Sidon, ido kisyak akitiyanakin Baal ka akilip neni a Baal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todukok iŋes Namuroet aŋuna a Baal kai a Baal ŋina abu iŋes todukok Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau Aab tari etorube a akuj a ŋina enyaritae Asera, kitiya ŋace ŋuna alalak ŋuna apotu kitoŋoa Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael, kitiya iŋes ŋuna aronok nooi akilo ŋuna etiyato ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu epukato Isirael eriŋa iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alorwa a ŋulu epukator iŋes, abu Kiel ŋolo alo Besel todukok Yeriko, todukok akisyakinet ŋina ka arwatata etacit kan Abiram lokoku keŋ ŋolo kiyae, ido tosipok ŋipukei etacit kan Segub lokoku keŋ ŋolo ŋororit, lopite ŋolo alimunitere anakirot ke Ekapolon aŋina alimuni Yosua a lokoku a Nun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
